  import --from <provider|all> [--dry-run] [--limit N]
                              Import this machine's agent transcripts
  rebuild [--yes]             Delete the local store and re-import every
                              transcript
  budget <id> [--max-usd N] [--max-tokens N]
                              Check a session against a spend limit
  sync [--no-network]         Import what changed since the last import, refresh
                              prices

Flags
  --harness <string>          Only sessions from this harness, e.g. claude
  --worktree <string>         Only sessions in this worktree, by path
  --limit <int> (default 50)  List at most this many sessions (default 50)
